Subject: [PATCH 5/7] docs: fix internal inconsistency on what Fase 6 covers

phase_log/README.md's table correctly said Fase 6 = Guardian
Orchestrator + Module Registry integration, THEN Release + KuroTech
landing page (both under Fase 6). But fase_5.md's own text
contradicted that, treating the integration work as happening BEFORE
Fase 6 and defining Fase 6 as release-only. Aligned fase_5.md and
docs/roadmap/dfir-depth.md to the correct single definition: Fase 6
starts with Guardian Orchestrator/Module Registry integration, and
Release+landing page is planned concretely once that integration is
solid -- both are Fase 6, not two separate phases.
---
 docs/phase_log/fase_5.md   | 30 ++++++++++++++----------------
 docs/roadmap/dfir-depth.md |  3 ++-
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

